---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About SteadyFocusCo"
  description="Planning and organization tools for overwhelmed minds. SteadyFocusCo creates printable planners and free digital tools for ADHD, students, and anyone who finds traditional planning systems don't work for them."
>
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h1>About SteadyFocusCo</h1>

      <p>
        SteadyFocusCo makes planning tools for people whose brains don't do linear.
        If you've ever stared at a pristine planner only to abandon it two weeks later,
        or if traditional to-do lists leave you feeling worse instead of organized —
        you're in the right place.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site offers free digital tools and printable resources designed for ADHD
        brains, busy students, and anyone who feels overwhelmed by conventional
        planning systems. Everything here is built around the idea that organization
        should work <em>with</em> how your brain actually functions, not against it.
      </p>

      <p>
        The free tools and printables on this site are companion resources to the
        SteadyFocusCo Etsy shop, where you'll find matching printable planners and
        organizational systems available for instant download. Whether you're here
        for the free tools or shopping for a complete planning system, the goal is
        the same: to help you build routines and systems that actually stick.
      </p>

      <p>
        No perfection required. No complicated systems to maintain. Just practical
        tools that meet you where you are.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 3rem auto 4rem;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-content h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-content em {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .about-page {
      margin: 2rem auto 3rem;
    }

    .about-content p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>